   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2013-11-20",
   "text": "Permanently Protecting Tenants at Foreclosure Act of 2013 - Amends the Protecting Tenants at Foreclosure Act of 2009 to repeal its sunset date December 31, 2012 (thus making the Act permanent). \n Establishes a private right of action to enforce compliance with such Act."
